      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "No da ist used for formal and written expressions. \nIt is used to give a sentence a tone of explanation. Or of asking for an explanation, if it is followed by \"ka\". \nThe \"no\" makes the whole preceding part of the sentence into a single noun-like entity.\n\n\"no\" is often abbreviated to \"n\" in the common speech.",
      "html": "No da ist used for formal and written expressions. <br/>It is used to give a sentence a tone of explanation. Or of asking for an explanation, if it is followed by \"ka\". <br/>The \"no\" makes the whole preceding part of the sentence into a single noun-like entity.<br/><br/>\"no\" is often abbreviated to \"n\" in the common speech.",
